WEBVTT

00:11:59.537 --> 00:12:01.371
I had come for remorse.

00:12:02.204 --> 00:12:06.079
And so I now went looking for remorse
and threw truth under the bus.

00:12:06.871 --> 00:12:09.871
"I understand," I said,
"that the crash was not your fault,

00:12:09.912 --> 00:12:13.162
but does it make you sad
that others suffered?"

00:12:14.746 --> 00:12:16.662
Abed spoke three quick words.

00:12:16.662 --> 00:12:18.746
"Yes, I suffered."

00:12:20.746 --> 00:12:22.871
Abed then told me why he'd suffered.

00:12:23.871 --> 00:12:26.537
He'd lived an unholy life
before the crash,

00:12:26.537 --> 00:12:28.787
and so God had ordained the crash,

00:12:28.787 --> 00:12:30.579
but now, he said, he was religious,